{
  "_about": "Which REAL captured CLI output each clihealth signal (packages/shared/src/clihealth/healthcatalog.ts) is tested against. Read by tools/screenfixtures.mjs. A path is relative to this folder; a `*` matches within one folder. `cli` names the CLI version the capture came from when the file has no `Claude Code vX.Y.Z` banner to read it off. `role`: `match` = a test asserts the reader FINDS its thing on this screen; `guard` = a test asserts it does NOT misfire on it. Hand-typed strings inside a test file are not fixtures and are never listed here.",
